WEBVTT

00:03:58.288 --> 00:04:01.371
Before her death,
she built her own mausoleum

00:04:01.371 --> 00:04:05.413
with a madrasa, garden, 
public shower, and palace,

00:04:05.413 --> 00:04:08.121
decorated with her signature 
tree of pearls

00:04:08.121 --> 00:04:10.579
to remind Egyptians who made it.